{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"76f84dcf-f5f4-45ec-abd3-e400efc3a9ad","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///tmp/h-jEJnh0/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented on the registration and offers screens using the `Analytics.capture` wrapper.\n\n### Overview of Changes\n- [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-jEJnh0/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart):\n  - `registration_email_started`: Emitted once when user starts typing their email (no PII sent).\n  - `registration_phone_started`: Emitted once when user starts typing their phone number (no PII sent).\n  - `loan_amount_changed`: Emitted when the loan amount slider changes, with `amount` (int).\n  - `terms_accepted`: Emitted when the terms and conditions checkbox is ticked.\n  - `registration_continue_tapped`: Emitted when the Continue button is tapped, with `amount` (int) and `terms` (bool).\n- [`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-jEJnh0/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart):\n  - `offers_scrolled`: Emitted via `NotificationListener\u003cScrollNotification\u003e` on scroll updates with `offset` (double, `notification.metrics.pixels`).\n- [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-jEJnh0/ANSWER.md):\n  - Documented what was done in detail.\n","duration_seconds":97.67504,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":190697,"output_tokens":3869,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":156051,"total_tokens":194566}}}
